  "definition": "Appearance",
  "effectiveDate": "2005-12-09",
  "historyNote": "#2659, eff 3-28-84; EXPIRED 3-28-90 (see Cla 201.03) New. #5481, eff 11-1-92, EXPIRED: 11-1-98 New. #8509, eff 12-09-05",
